<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers to list shares in Namibia, Botswana.</title>
<headline>De Beers to list shares in Namibia, Botswana.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African diamond giant De Beers Ltd said on Wednesday that it planned to list its De Beers/Centenary linked units on the stock exchanges of Botswana and Namibia.</p>
<p>De Beers is listed in Johannesburg, while De Beers Centenary is listed in Switzerland.</p>
<p>The listing in Namibia will start from March 6, with the Botswana listing coming a day later, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
